 ('south-korean-democratization-complete','South Korean democratization: the long struggle','Ten linked readings of the Rhee government, April Revolution, Second Republic, 1961 coup, Park and Yushin, opposition movements, Gwangju and the 1987 constitutional transition.','Ten connected readings',[f'IX.4.{i}' for i in range(1,11)]),
